Savo is a fast-growing Africa focused investment and project development company with a specialisation in sustainable asset classes and complex transactions. 

With USD 70 million in transactions closed, we achieved revenue growth of 200% in 2021 and have generated USD 1 million in profit in less than 2 years of operation. Spanning the spectrum of project development and transaction support, we provide end-to-end advisory services and take equity in companies. Our core focus is developing sustainable businesses and setting companies up for success. To date, we have closed deals in Kenya, Ethiopia, Madagascar, Uganda, Cameroon and Nigeria. Assets include; sustainable industrial parks; port development;
affordable housing; captive power; sustainable sourcing, and; carbon asset development. We are headquartered in London, with our first subsidiary in Kenya later this year.
